      "body": "## Summary\n\nAdd a warning when a D3 code-readout checkpoint is configured with\n`Qwen3_5ForConditionalGeneration`.\n\nThis architecture selects the generic generation path rather than native D3\nclassification. The warning explains that users should remove an explicit\narchitecture override to allow native D3 detection.\n\n## Changes\n\n- Detect `decision_config.json` with format ID `d3-code-readout-v1` when the\n  configured architecture is `Qwen3_5ForConditionalGeneration`.\n- Warn about the generation architecture override without changing the\n  explicitly configured architecture.\n- Add tests for the warning, unrelated or malformed decision configs, native\n  D3 detection, and Clef detection precedence.\n\n## Scope\n\nThis change adds a diagnostic warning only. It does not change model\nselection, inference behavior, GDN kernels, or D3 scoring.",
